{"id":"fd47604c237781fa","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-relative-recursion.md","title":"Relative Recursion","display":"df-relative-recursion — Relative Recursion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-relative-recursion","aliases":["88-df-relative-recursion"],"display":"df-relative-recursion — Relative Recursion","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-relative-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-relative-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-recursion — Relative Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是元数，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为候选函数图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 已定义的固定数码函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e^A\">\\(M_e^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\\)</span> 是下述有元数及省略元数的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^A,A)\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec x),y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^A)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^A,A)\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec x),y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^A)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>元数现在进入谓词参数表，不再在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\\)</span> 的右侧留下游离的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。这里定义的是部分相对可计算性；若要求总相对递归函数，还须加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。图等价式同时限制收敛域与输出值，不使用普通机器的输出谓词来代替神谕计算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 见 [[88-df-partial-function]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 是 [[88-df-encoding]] 已定义的固定数码函数。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 见 [[88-df-partial-function]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 是 [[88-df-encoding]] 已定义的固定数码函数。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_e^A$、$\\mathrm{OracleTM}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_e^A$、$\\mathrm{OracleTM}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"M_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^A,A)\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec x),y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^A)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{RelRec}_k(f,A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelRec}(f,A)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k","display":false}],"bytes":1725,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-relative-recursion]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[[88-df-finite-extension